    {
      "en": {
        "short": "PEFT",
        "title": "Train only a tiny add-on",
        "body": [
          "PEFT methods like LoRA train only a tiny add-on.",
          "They add small trainable modules (adapters) rather than touching the base weights."
        ]
      },
